import source_queries.dl

class:
    patterns:
        UI source navigation
    members:
        editor as a pointer to UI source editor
        document as a pointer to UI source document
        query as a pointer to UI source query
        generation as an integer
        phase as an integer
        uri as a string
        line as an integer
        character as an integer
        end line as an integer
        end character as an integer

to [cancel UI source navigation] {a pointer to UI source navigation:navigation}:
    if navigation's query != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI source query):
        cancel UI source query (navigation's query)
    set the value at navigation to a new UI source navigation
